1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,240
My audiences and even people who meet me are confronted.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:06,260
They're confronted with what I am inside and out.

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:09,920
I thank Ms. Nina Simone for the work that she did and for the music that she created.

4
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:17,200
But I thank her for saying things like this because it really does create a blueprint for radical thought as it applies to artistry.

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:23,480
And how we show up as people in the world and as public figures and how we demand our public figures show up as well.

